OL,3,GNEWSAPolice identify pedestrian killed
OL,4,Ain Grangemouth crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have named a pedestrian who died
OL,7,Fafter being hit by a car in Grangemouth
OL,8,Flast week.
OL,10,FSean McGinley, 24, was pronounced dead
OL,11,Fat the scene on Newlands Road after
OL,12,Fbeing struck by a Ford Fiesta at 23:15
OL,13,Flast Monday.
OL,15,FOfficers had been trying to establish
OL,16,Fhis identity and had appealed for
OL,17,Fwitnesses to the incident.
OL,19,FThe 35-year-old male driver of the car
OL,20,Fwas taken to hospital as a precaution
OL,21,Fand arrested. He was later released.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
